---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin calls supplyTokens()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_tge: caller is projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_tge --> q_revert_tge: TGE details not published (askToken not set)
    q_check_tge --> q_check_supplied: TGE details published
    q_revert_tge --> [*]: revert TgeNotPublished
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_fees: tokensSupplied == false
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_calc_fees --> q_calc_total: legionTokenFee = allocatedTokenAmount * legionFeeOnTokensSoldBps / 10000, referrerTokenFee = allocatedTokenAmount * referrerFeeOnTokensSoldBps / 10000
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = allocatedTokenAmount + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
    q_transfer --> q_set_flag: transfer totalRequired askToken from projectAdmin to contract
    q_set_flag --> q_emit: tokensSupplied = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied(allocatedTokenAmount, legionTokenFee, referrerTokenFee)

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: Token fees calculated using basis points (bps / 10000)
        INV-002: Total tokens transferred = allocatedTokenAmount + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
        INV-003: tokensSupplied transitions from false to true exactly once
    end note
